# `$0.001 per 1k_tokens` — Rate literal, Money numerator + unit_quantity
# denominator. This is the only rate use case in support-agent.ais (for
# `model.cost_max`). The `_tokens` suffix is descriptive metadata; the
# AST stores only the Size (1024). See LANGUAGE-SPEC-v0.md §8 EBNF.
$0.001 per 1k_tokens
